data: {"id": "5eb7abfa9a234931-thinking-parallel_evidence-686", "run_id": "5eb7abfa9a234931", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集事实、冲突和缺口\n\n**实体**\n- Pod: `aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b` (UID: `aa952049-8c4b-4522-92f6-9fad5f3fc865`)\n\n**已验证事实**\n- **状态**: Pod 当前处于 `CrashLoopBackOff`，`ready=False`，重启 19 次，最后退码 `exitCode=2`。\n- **日志**: 最近一次（及崩溃前）`app` 容器日志显示 `runtime process exiting`，伴随 HTTP 500 错误，路径 `/work`。\n- **链路**: DeepFlow flow 和 Tempo span 显示 HTTP 请求 `GET /work` 产生 500 响应，`trace_id=d37042c083146b7c0693f494aea075f8`。\n- **资源**: 崩溃瞬间资源（CPU/内存）未显示 OOM 或 CPU Throttling 迹象（指标值处于极低水平）。\n\n**冲突与矛盾**\n- 上游候选“Error 的直接原因待验", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1788788755130, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

